67","lemma":"עֲלַע","transliteration":"ala","gloss":"rib"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}